{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01135","headline":"相和歌辞 铜雀台 · 张氏琰","name":"相和歌辞 铜雀台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君王冥寞不可见，铜雀歌舞空裴回。\n西陵啧啧悲宿鸟，空殿沈沈闭青苔。\n青苔无人迹，红粉空相哀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张氏琰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}